{:title "Place in Smile, a Community Served by Its Own Local AI"
 :description "What Place is in THE MAP of Smile, a community served by its own local models, keeping its own ledger, its own words and what it chooses to share, and the words of 3 October 2026 that named individuation, with every source."
 :keywords "community local AI, individuation of communities, local language models, community ledger, Smile prompt language place, history of Smile"
 :lede "In THE MAP, a place is a community served by its own local AI. Its models run on its own devices, it keeps its own ledger and its own words, and what leaves it is decided by the community."
 :paras
 ["THE MAP sets the parts. The prompts and parameters are tuned to the place, its land, language, season and people. What the community records enters its own ledger first. What leaves travels as a list of hashes and descriptions it has agreed to share. A prompt that works on a foundation model is carried to the place's own model, and each place carries its own lens over the shared pool."
 "My words on it are from 3 October 2026, and they speak of the language a community refines together. “The shared refinement of language is the individuation of the group, with AI this becomes their shared foundation, technology, method and practice they can use agentically.”[[m:2026-10-03]] And in the osrs project the same day, “Note that for Smile by serving the individuation of local communtiies they are also harmonising themselves with the social memory complex timeline that integrates that individuation in the map”.[[m:2026-10-03#2]]"
 "Individuation is also where [[t:what-smile-is-for]] ends, and a place's prompts reach its own models by [[t:transfer]]."]
